{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\n\nRASTER #1,1,0,0,480,\u0022Blue,Black\u0022\nRASTER GFXMODE 1,0 \n\nSAM PLAY \u0022Sound/Scout.mp3\u0022\n\nINKG WHITE\nFONT SET 70,100,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nFONT STYLE \u0022Bold Italic\u0022\nPRINTG AT 1,7,\u0022PHALANX\u0022\nPRINTG AT 2,8,\u0022RULES\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 1\nINKG Red\nFONT SET 100,130,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nFONT STYLE \u0022Bold Italic\u0022\nPRINTG AT 0,0,\u0022TJOSAN\u0022\nSCREEN SELECT 0\n\nPARTICLE 2,40\nRASTER GFXMODE 0,1 \nRASTER 1,0,Y,480,\u0022Red,Orange,Yellow,Green,Blue,Indigo,Violet,Red\u0022\n\nY=0 : VY=0 : VX=0\nMainLoop:\n  Y=Y-1\n  IF Y=-480 THEN Y=0\n\n  SCROLL 0,SIN(VX)*20,SIN(-VY)*200-190\n  VY=VY\u002B1\n  IF VY=180 THEN VY=0\n  \n  VX=VX\u002B10\n  IF VX=360 THEN VX=0\n    \n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop\n"}